1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
You think China's famous old towns are Pingyao and Lijiang. I'm your China Travel Expert.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,800
China names four great ancient cities. Most travellers can name three.

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:10,200
The fourth is Langzhong, in Sichuan — over 2,300 years old.

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,600
Its lanes follow a feng-shui grid, water on three sides.

5
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,800
Yet it draws a fraction of Lijiang's crowds.

6
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,600
Double-tap if you'd add a town nobody books.

7
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:23,600
★ Expert Tip: Climb Zhongtian Tower for the full chessboard-street view.

8
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:27,200
Pingyao, Lijiang, Langzhong — which old town wins? Tell me below.
